{
"id": 983,
"en": "Climax Heat",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|CATEGORY + tabla tips_tutorial|TIPS_NAME"
},
{
"id": 984,
"en": "Smash an opponent against a wall.\nThe most basic of basic Heat Actions.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 985,
"en": "Crush an opponent from behind.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 986,
"en": "Smash an opponent's head against an object.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 987,
"en": "Use a nearby pole to crush an unsuspecting\nopponent.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 988,
"en": "A fierce attack that destroys an opponent's\ntailbone.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 989,
"en": "Drop an opponent on a protruding object.\nIt's a real brain buster.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 990,
"en": "Quickly eliminate an opponent by throwing them\noff of a high place.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 991,
"en": "An ancient attack that splits open an enemy's\nhead using their own body weight. Learn from\nthe past to protect the future.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 992,
"en": "This deadly move will let you kick your opponent into\nthe wall repeatedly.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 993,
"en": "Kick and smash your opponent into a guard rail\nafter throwing him with this relentless move.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 994,
"en": "Use a pole to crash down on an enemy with your\nknees from a high altitude.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 995,
"en": "Lift up an enemy and give him a giant heave into\nthe wall. A move for Saejima only.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 996,
"en": "Fling your opponent into a chain-link fence,\nand then fling yourself into your opponent.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 997,
"en": "Smash an opponent against a fence and grate\ntheir head with it. Take a little off the top.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 998,
"en": "Pick up an enemy and slam him into the wall.\nThis is sure to terrify your opponent.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 999,
"en": "Tackle an enemy near a wall and slam them against it.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1000,
"en": "Put an enemy on ice and turn them into a snowman. You'll need a carrot and a wooden carving.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1001,
"en": "Grab your opponent by the feet and ruthlessly\nplow them into a surface.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1002,
"en": "Show your devilish side by picking up an enemy\nand swinging them into a wall. ",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1003,
"en": "Pick up a foe and swing them into a pole.\nMaybe catching a glimpse of heaven will help them\nrealize the error of their ways.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1004,
"en": "Swing a foe around and use them as a weapon.\nThose involved catch a glimpse into hell.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1005,
"en": "Grab an opponent and smash them into the\nground. Put all your strength, spirit, and weight\ninto a single devastating blow!",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1006,
"en": "Surprise an opponent while you're knocked down\nby breaking their shins.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1007,
"en": "A secret street fighting technique. Skillfully\nuse a lit cigarette to create an opening.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1008,
"en": "Strike down your opponents with frightful\nspeed.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1009,
"en": "Show an enemy grabbing you that they should to keep their hands to themselves by piledriving them.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1010,
"en": "Pass between your enemy's legs after My Meteor Tackle then, send him flying.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1011,
"en": "Pull a fallen enemy up off the ground and mercilessly slam him back down. Time is money.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1012,
"en": "Take out two birds with one stone by dropping\none enemy onto another who's lying on the\nground.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1013,
"en": "No need to damage your weapons this time.\nJust stomp on your opponent.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1014,
"en": "Turn the tables by tackling the opponent and punching them while they're down. A vicious attack for a cornered attacker.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1015,
"en": "Keep your weapons pristine and send your\nenemy flying with a well-placed kick. Make them\nwish you had used a weapon.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1016,
"en": "A devastating attack. Just when the enemy\nthinks you're finished, come down upon them with\nall your might.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1017,
"en": "A simple and popular attack. Throw an object\nonto a downed enemy, putting the force of your\nbody and soul behind it.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1018,
"en": "Force something on an opponent's head and spin it. Then break them \nwith a knife hand strike as though they were a pile of bricks.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1019,
"en": "A graceful, majestic strike that uses nunchaku\nto their utmost potential.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1020,
"en": "Force a mystery liquid down an enemy's throat.\nDoes more psychological damage than physical.\n...Probably.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1021,
"en": "Charge your stun gun with electrified passion,\npowering it up beyond its physical limits.\nTranscends modern understanding of physics.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1022,
"en": "Get a strike on your opponent's shins and\nbowl them into the gutter. Spare no mercy.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1023,
"en": "Inject a mysterious syringe into an opponent's\nposterior. Hopefully it isn't too dangerous.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1024,
"en": "Send an opponent flying down range. Not a\nfair way to play, but a nice shot nonetheless.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1025,
"en": "A basic attack passed down through the Lotus\nSchool. Trips the opponent, and then deals\nadditional attacks.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1026,
"en": "Use the weight of the hammer to pound enemies\ninto the ground with a series of powerful\nblows.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1027,
"en": "Lift enemies up from between their legs and\nslam them onto the ground.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1028,
"en": "A relentless three-punch combo using brass knuckles.\nYou can use this when Saejima has brass knuckles equipped.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1029,
"en": "Rattle an enemy's brains with a blow to the\nhead, then finish him with a final blow.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1030,
"en": "Drop something heavy on an enemy's head.\nSometimes simple is best.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1031,
"en": "Climax Heat\nBuild up power before delivering a savage kick.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1032,
"en": "Climax Heat\nThrust your body into your enemy for major damage.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1033,
"en": "Climax Heat\nPerform the ultimate reversal move while on death's door.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1034,
"en": "Climax Heat\nPound the ground with built-up power to send enemies flying.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1035,
"en": "Climax Heat\nLift up an enemy you have grabbed, then slam him down.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1036,
"en": "Climax Heat\nCharge forward and send your enemy flying. ",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1037,
"en": "Climax Heat\nDeliver a combo of assorted kicks.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1038,
"en": "Climax Heat\nDeliver a devastating attack as you come hurtling down.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1039,
"en": "Climax Heat\nViolently slam an airborne enemy down to the ground.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1040,
"en": "Climax Heat\nDrag your enemy around on the pavement. Road rash is no joke.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1041,
"en": "Climax Heat\nMow down enemies with a long pole.",
"ctx": "tabla complete_heat|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 1042,
"en": "Climax Heat\nThrow your weapon at the enemy, catch it as it bounces, and repeat.",
